## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `src/index.ts` | Public API (ES module) |
| `src/cli.ts` | Command-line entry point |
| `test/` | Tests using Node's built-in `node:test` runner, run against the compiled output |
| `tsconfig.json` | Strict TypeScript settings; `tsc` compiles `src/` and `test/` into `dist/` |
| `eslint.config.js` | ESLint flat config with typescript-eslint |
| `docs/` | Documentation and ADRs |

TypeScript is pinned to 6.x: TypeScript 7 drops `tsserver`, which editor and AI-assistant language servers still use.

## Decisions

Record significant decisions as short ADRs in `docs/adr/` (one file per decision).
